% Hunter
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of an Epilog game, written by the Epilog translator
% from hunter.hrf (kept in sources/): the operations are causal laws, the
% views over the state intensional fluents.
% The scenario is a play EpilogJS made; LPS2's final state of it is checked against EpilogJS's
% (test_epilog.pl).
% Source: the Epilog Games page, http://epilog.stanford.edu/homepage/game.php?game=hunter
%
% DISCLAIMER. This program was written by a translator from a program of another
% system. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
% implied, including any warranty that it is accurate, complete or fit for a
% particular purpose. The translation may be wrong: check it against its source
% before relying on it. It is not legal, tax, insurance, financial or other
% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move move with *a row*, *a col*, *a thing* and *a second thing* is made; known as move.

the fluents are:
    *a count* captures; known as captures.
    *a row* cell *a col* with *a piece*; known as cell.
    *a thing* is a control; known as control.
    *an old* is a step; known as step.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move move with *a row*, *a col*, *a thing* and *a second thing* is legal; known as legal_move.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *a thing* knightmove *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    the succ of *an old* is *a thing*.
    the add one row of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    the add two row of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    the add one col of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    the add two col of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    the scoremap of *a count* is *a goal*.

the knowledge base hunter includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/hunter.hrf".

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the add one row of the thing is the third thing
    and the add two col of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the add one row of the thing is the third thing
    and the add two col of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the add one row of the third thing is the thing
    and the add two col of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the add one row of the third thing is the thing
    and the add two col of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the add two row of the thing is the third thing
    and the add one col of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the add two row of the thing is the third thing
    and the add one col of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the add two row of the third thing is the thing
    and the add one col of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the add two row of the third thing is the thing
    and the add one col of the fourth thing is the second thing.

the succ of 0 is 1.

the succ of 1 is 2.

the succ of 2 is 3.

the succ of 3 is 4.

the succ of 4 is 5.

the succ of 5 is 6.

the succ of 6 is 7.

the succ of 7 is 8.

the succ of 8 is 9.

the succ of 9 is 10.

the succ of 10 is 11.

the succ of 11 is 12.

the succ of 12 is 13.

the succ of 13 is 14.

the succ of 14 is 15.

the succ of 15 is 16.

the add one row of 1 is 2.

the add one row of 2 is 3.

the add one row of 3 is 4.

the add one row of 4 is 5.

the add two row of 1 is 3.

the add two row of 2 is 4.

the add two row of 3 is 5.

the add one col of 1 is 2.

the add one col of 2 is 3.

the add two col of 1 is 3.

the scoremap of 0 is 0.

the scoremap of 1 is 1.

the scoremap of 2 is 3.

the scoremap of 3 is 7.

the scoremap of 4 is 11.

the scoremap of 5 is 16.

the scoremap of 6 is 22.

the scoremap of 7 is 29.

the scoremap of 8 is 37.

the scoremap of 9 is 45.

the scoremap of 10 is 54.

the scoremap of 11 is 64.

the scoremap of 12 is 75.

the scoremap of 13 is 87.

the scoremap of 14 is 100.

the move move with a row, a col, a thing and a second thing is legal at a time if
    the row cell the col with knight at the time
    and the row knightmove the col with the thing with the second thing.

the goal of robot is a number at a time if
    a count captures at the time
    and the scoremap of the count is the number.

the game is terminal at a time if
    16 is a step at the time.

when the move move with a row, a col, a thing and a second thing is made
then the thing cell the second thing with knight
    and the row cell the col with blank
    and it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with blank
    and it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with pawn
    and it is not the case that the row cell the col with knight.

when the move move with a row, a col, a thing and a second thing is made
    and the thing cell the second thing with pawn
    and a count captures
    and the succ of the count is a third thing
then the third thing captures
    and it is not the case that the count captures.

when the move move with a row, a col, a thing and a second thing is made
    and an old is a step
    and the succ of the old is a third thing
then the third thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the old is a step.

it must not be true that
    the move move with a row, a col, a thing and a second thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the row, the col, the thing and the second thing is legal.

initially 1 cell 1 with knight
    and 1 cell 2 with pawn
    and 1 cell 3 with pawn
    and 2 cell 1 with pawn
    and 2 cell 2 with pawn
    and 2 cell 3 with pawn
    and 3 cell 1 with pawn
    and 3 cell 2 with pawn
    and 3 cell 3 with pawn
    and 4 cell 1 with pawn
    and 4 cell 2 with pawn
    and 4 cell 3 with pawn
    and 5 cell 1 with pawn
    and 5 cell 2 with pawn
    and 5 cell 3 with pawn
    and 0 captures
    and 1 is a step
    and robot is a control.

