%   - captures(10)
%   - control(robot)
%   - step(13)
%   - cell(1,1,blank)
%   - cell(1,2,pawn)
%   - cell(1,3,blank)
%   - cell(2,1,blank)
%   - cell(2,2,blank)
%   - cell(2,3,blank)
%   - cell(3,1,blank)
%   - cell(3,2,blank)
%   - cell(3,3,pawn)
%   - cell(4,1,blank)
%   - cell(4,2,knight)
%   - cell(4,3,blank)
%   - cell(5,1,pawn)
%   - cell(5,2,pawn)
%   - cell(5,3,blank)
scenario play is:
    the move move with 1, 1, 2 and 3 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move move with 2, 3, 3 and 1 is made from 2 to 3.
    the move move with 3, 1, 4 and 3 is made from 3 to 4.
    the move move with 4, 3, 2 and 2 is made from 4 to 5.
    the move move with 2, 2, 4 and 1 is made from 5 to 6.
    the move move with 4, 1, 5 and 3 is made from 6 to 7.
    the move move with 5, 3, 3 and 2 is made from 7 to 8.
    the move move with 3, 2, 1 and 3 is made from 8 to 9.
    the move move with 1, 3, 2 and 1 is made from 9 to 10.
    the move move with 2, 1, 1 and 3 is made from 10 to 11.
    the move move with 1, 3, 2 and 1 is made from 11 to 12.
    the move move with 2, 1, 4 and 2 is made from 12 to 13.

